## 🏛️ PART 1 — FOUNDATION

### 1. Pip का इतिहास — यह आया कहाँ से?

**Pip का full form:**
- **Percentage In Point** (official)
- **Price Interest Point** (also used)

**History Timeline:**

| Year | Event |
|------|-------|
| 1971 | Bretton Woods collapse, currencies free-float |
| 1980s | Interbank market grows, Pip standardizes |
| 1990s | Retail Forex begins, Pip becomes universal |
