## 📐 PART 4 — ADVANCED CONCEPTS

### 15. Pipette / Fractional Pip

**5th Decimal Place:**
```
1.10505
      ↑
      └── 5th decimal = Pipette = 0.1 pip = 1/10 pip
```

**Gold में भी:**
- Normal pip = 0.01
- Pipette = 0.001 (2000.001)

---

### 16. Spread — Pip से Relation

**Structure:**
- **Bid** = Broker buys from you
- **Ask** = Broker sells to you
- **Spread** = Ask - Bid

**Examples:**
| Instrument | Bid | Ask | Spread |
|------------|-----|-----|--------|
| EURUSD | 1.10500 | 1.10503 | 0.3 pips (3 pipettes) |
| Gold | 1999.80 | 2000.20 | 40 pips |

**Real Impact:**
- Gold Buy @ 2000.20, Market @ 1999.80
- **Instant 40 pip loss!**
- Target 100 pips → Need 140 pip move for 100 net profit

---

### 17. Risk Management — Risk Per Trade

**Professional Rule:** Max 1-2% account risk per trade

**Formula:** `Lot Size = Risk Amount ÷ (SL Pips × Pip Value)`

**Example:**
```
Risk: $10 | SL: 50 pips | Pip Value: $0.10 (0.01 lot Gold)
Lot Size = $10 ÷ (50 × $0.10) = $10 ÷ $5 = 0.02 lots
```

**Risk Table — Gold:**

| Account | 1% Risk | SL 50p | SL 100p | SL 200p | SL 500p |
|---------|---------|--------|---------|---------|---------|
| $500 | $5 | 0.05 | 0.025 | 0.01 | 0.005 |
| $1,000 | $10 | 0.10 | 0.05 | 0.025 | 0.01 |
| $5,000 | $50 | 0.50 | 0.25 | 0.10 | 0.05 |
| $10,000 | $100 | 1.00 | 0.50 | 0.25 | 0.10 |

---

### 18. Risk:Reward Ratio

**Formula:** `R:R = Risk Pips : Reward Pips`

| R:R | SL | TP | Break-Even Win% |
|-----|----|----|-----------------|
| 1:1 | 50 | 50 | > 50% |
| 1:2 | 50 | 100 | > 33% |
| 1:3 | 50 | 150 | > 25% |
| 1:5 | 50 | 250 | > 16.7% |

**1:2 Example (10 trades):**
- 5 wins × 100 pips = +500
- 5 losses × 50 pips = -250
- **Net: +250 pips** (50% win rate = profitable!)

> **Key:** Better R:R = Less win rate needed for profit

---

### 19. ATR और Daily Pip Range

**ATR = Average True Range**

| Pair | Daily Range | Pip Range | Volatility |
|------|-------------|-----------|------------|
| EURUSD | $80-100 | 80-100 pips | Medium |
| GBPUSD | $100-130 | 100-130 pips | High |
| USDJPY | $70-90 | 70-90 pips | Medium |
| **XAUUSD** | **$15-30** | **1500-3000 pips** | **Very High** |

**ATR-based SL:**
- Gold ATR = 1500 pips
- SL 50 pips = Too tight (will hit randomly)
- **Better:** SL = 500-750 pips (30-50% of ATR)

