## ❓ PART 7 — COMMON CONFUSIONS

### 25. Top 10 Doubts Solved

| # | Question | Answer |
|---|----------|--------|
| 1 | Gold में $1 = 1 pip? | ❌ NO — $1 = **100 pips** |
| 2 | EURUSD 100 pips = बड़ा move? | ✅ Yes, almost full daily range |
| 3 | ज्यादा pips = ज्यादा profit? | ❌ Always नहीं — Lot size matters |
| 4 | Negative pips होते हैं? | Direction के लिए, calculation में absolute value |
| 5 | Pip = Point? | Mostly same, technically Point = 1 unit last decimal |
| 6 | Spread pips में count? | ✅ YES — Gold ~40 pips, EURUSD ~1-2 pips |
| 7 | Swap pips में? | ❌ NO — Dollar में, but adds to total P&L |
| 8 | Different brokers = different pips? | Pips same, spread/execution different |
| 9 | Silver (XAGUSD) pip? | 0.001 (Gold से different!) |
| 10 | Pip value always USD? | Account currency पर depend — usually USD |

